      "incident_updates": [
        {
          "id": "f4pz5fqn2h1b",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "As part of our commitment to reliability and security, LaunchDarkly will retire all API versions except 20240415 on December 31, 2026.\n\nAfter this date, all requests made to retired versions will stop working. To avoid disruption, customers must update integrations and workflows to use version 20240415 before the retirement date. \n\nWe previously announced the end of life (EOL) for older versions as of April 30, 2025. They have remained available during a grace period, which will end on December 31, 2026\n\nFor full details, see our API version changelog: https://launchdarkly.com/docs/api#api-version-changelog\n\nUpgrading now ensures uninterrupted access and provides immediate improvements in performance and functionality. \n\nWe recognize this may be a large undertaking, which is why we are providing extended notice. If you need guidance, please reach out to your account team or contact our support team.",
